{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the speed barrier. Defy gravity. Race through glowing tracks on alien worlds.</strong></h2><br>A high-velocity sci-fi racing game where you pilot neon-lit hoverbikes inside colossal transparent tunnels sprawled across distant planets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>Extreme speed</strong></h2>Push past the speed of sound as you accelerate through looping tracks and vertical tunnels that twist across alien landscapes.<br><br>Gravity-Defying Racing \u2013 Your vehicle sticks to the inner surface of massive semi-transparent tubes. Ride on the ceiling, spiral around corners, and dodge obstacles at breakneck speeds.<br><br>Neon-Slick Visuals \u2013 Inspired by retro-futuristic aesthetics, with glowing bikes, luminous tracks, and galactic vistas in the background.<br><br>Multiple Planets, Unique Tracks \u2013 Race across a variety of planets, each with different environmental effects, gravity, and visual themes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Passion project</strong></h2><strong>&quot;Cologne&quot;</strong> was my first released game \u2014 an experiment in speed and style, crafted with love for old-school sci-fi racers. The name might not make much sense, but the adrenaline rush sure will.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/444740?t=1749402525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749402525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749402525","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/444740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749402525","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","i